.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_validate-matrix.py:411:          "C1 authorizes a -systemextension value, but C1 creates development profiles only")
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_validate-matrix.py:414:              f'C1 capability line names an entitlement value instead of a capability name: {cap!r}')
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_validate-matrix.py:596:                  "reopensOnly", "ceremonyCostIsZero", "source"):
.temp/resources/TASK-260715-ypo7yo/TASK-260715-ypo7yo_validate-matrix.py:694:    # R30 Ceremony C1 may not authorize a capability or a record nothing needs.
