69-- VERIFICATION: 27 rules / 598 checks, exit 0, and **41 negative gates** (was 23) each re-introducing a defect and failing closed naming its rule — nine for the missing/mis-scoped exception, five for X1, four that delete or empty an assertion. That last group exists because the failure being fixed was an assertion set that did not cover its own contract; R27 now pins the assertion ids so the set cannot silently shrink again.
